  "updated_at": "2026-04-06",
  "bio": "Sergio Nezumi is a master tattoo artist based in Madrid, Spain, specializing in Japanese, realism, and watercolor styles with an impressive career tattooing since 1998. His work stands out for its exceptional cleanliness, ensuring each client's experience is not only artistically satisfying but also conducted under the highest hygiene standards. To book a session and witness his meticulous attention to cleanliness firsthand, reach out to Nezumi Tattoo Studio at sergionezumi33@gmail.com.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Madrid, Community Of Madrid, Spain",
  "tattooing_since": "1998"
